### Laravel — список фільмів
GET http://localhost:8001/api/movies
Accept: application/json

### Laravel — створити фільм
POST http://localhost:8001/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Dune: Part Two",
  "description": "Paul Atreides unites with the Fremen",
  "genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "duration_minutes": 166,
  "release_date": "2024-03-01",
  "age_rating": "12+"
}

### Laravel — отримати фільм
GET http://localhost:8001/api/movies/1
Accept: application/json

### Laravel — оновити фільм (частково)
PATCH http://localhost:8001/api/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "age_rating": "16+"
}

### Laravel — видалити фільм
DELETE http://localhost:8001/api/movies/1
Accept: application/json
